<title>POLAND: TENNIS-WARSAW CUP WOMEN'S SEMIFINALS POSTPONED BECAUSE OF RAIN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WARSAW CUP WOMEN'S SEMIFINALS POSTPONED BECAUSE OF RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal matches in the Warsaw Cup women's tennis tournament have been postponed until Sunday because of rain.</p>
<p>Organisers said the matches would be played on Sunday morning with the final planned for the afternoon.</p>
</text>
